# ascii :  97/1 127/1 | back ok | size  1 1 | last 65533 0 65533 0
# two :  128/2 2047/2 | back ok | size  2 0 2 0 | last 65533 0 65533 0
# three :  2048/3 55295/3 57344/3 65533/3 65535/3 | back ok | size  3 0 0 3 0 0 3 0 0 3 0 0 3 0 0 | last 65533 0 65533 0
